; Otter Raid -- Ollie sprites (multicolour 12x21, top-down, facing UP)
;
;   .  transparent   k  black outline ($D025)   w  white ($D026)
;   c  sprite colour (Ollie = BROWN 9)
; Each row is 12 fat pixels (2 hires px wide).  color= only sets the
; preview colour; the engine programs the real one.
;
; Swim cycle 0-1-2-3: left stroke, pull, right stroke (mirror), glide.
; UNDER0/1: plain silhouette + bubbles, meant to be recoloured (dark
; grey or black reads best as "under water"; plain blue would vanish).
@sprite OLLIE_SWIM0 color=9
....kkkk....
...kwkkwk...
.wkcwwwwckw.
..kckwwkck..
..kckcckck..
.kkcccccck..
.kckcccck...
..kkcccckk..
...kcccck...
...kcccck...
...kcccckk..
...kcccckk..
..kkcccckk..
..kkcccckck.
.kckkcckkk..
kcck.kcck...
kkk..kcck...
.....kcck...
......kck...
......kk....
............
